<!-- Hero Section -->
<div class="hero">
    <div class="hero-content">
        <h1>About Us</h1>
        <p>Who we are</p>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-image">
        <img src="/img/aboutus.jpg" alt="Home page">
    </div>
</div>

<!-- Main Content -->
<div class="content">

    <!-- Section 1: Text Left, Image Right -->
    <div class="intro-text-left" style="text-align: justify;">
        <p>
                AgriLearnPal is an honours project developed as part of a student’s final-year research in computing.
                    It combines machine learning and web technologies to create an interactive and educational platform
                    for crop analysis.
            
        </p>
    </div>
    <br>
    <hr class="green-divider">
    <br>
    <div class="intro-text-right" style="text-align: justify;">
        <p>
                    The project focuses on crops growable in the UK, such as potatoes, apples, and berries. The idea is
                    to provide an accessible tool that helps users recognize different crops, assess their health, and
                    gain insights into best cultivation practices.
                
            
        </p>
    </div>
    <br>
    <hr class="green-divider">
    <br>
    <div class="intro-text-left" style="text-align: justify;">
        <p>
                    This project was inspired by the increasing role of digital tools in education. Agriculture remains
                    a crucial yet often overlooked subject in modern learning. AgriLearnPal is designed to help students
                    and enthusiasts explore crops, analyze plant health, and gain valuable insights through an intuitive
                    and easy-to-use web application.
                
            
        </p>
    </div>



</div>







